CYP17 gene is associated with an increased risk of male breast cancer. &#x000a9; 1999 Cancer Research Campaign</p></abstract><kwd-group><kwd>CYP17 polymorphism</kwd><kwd>male breast cancer</kwd></kwd-group></article-meta></front></article>